BOSS Mordrax Dies
    Events
        Unit - A unit Takes damage
    Conditions
        (Damage Target) Equal to BossMordrax
        (Damage taken) Greater than or equal to ((Life of BossMordrax) - 0.41)
    Actions
        Event Response - Set Damage of Unit Damaged Event to ((Life of BossMordrax) - 1.00)
        Unit - Make BossMordrax Invulnerable
        Unit - Change ownership of BossMordrax to Neutral Passive and Retain color
        -------- Loot (with dummy unit) --------
        Set VariableSet BossMordrax_Point = (Position of BossMordrax)
        Unit - Create 1 MordraxDummy for Player 12 (Brown) at BossMordrax_Point facing Default building facing degrees
        Unit - Kill (Last created unit)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossMordrax_Point)
        -------- effects --------
        Sound - Play BloodSplat <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to BossMordrax
        Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the chest of BossMordrax using Objects\Spawnmodels\Other\HumanBloodCinematicEffect\HumanBloodCinematicEffect.mdl
        Special Effect - Destroy (Last created special effect)
        -------- Reset Boss + other starting initials --------
        Custom script:   call DisableTrigger(gg_trg_BOSS_Mordrax_Reset)
        -------- Disable chat --------
        Custom script:   call DisableTrigger(gg_trg_BOSS_Mordrax_Chat_During)
        Custom script:   call DisableTrigger(gg_trg_BOSS_Mordrax_Chat_Ability)
        Custom script:   call DisableTrigger(gg_trg_BOSS_Mordrax_Chat_Hero_Dies)
        Custom script:   call DisableTrigger(gg_trg_BOSS_Mordrax_Chat_LowHP)
        -------- =================== --------
        -------- Begin the flight --------
        Custom script:   call TriggerExecute(gg_trg_BOSS_Mordrax_DeathFlight)
        Wait 2.00 seconds
        -------- Boss Chat --------
        Custom script:   call TriggerExecute(gg_trg_BOSS_Mordrax_Chat_Dies)
        Wait ExSoundDuration seconds
        -------- =================== --------
        -------- Turn on BOSS fight starting trigger --------
        -------- Respawn --------
        Set VariableSet BOSS_RT = (Random real number between 240.00 and 500.00)
        Countdown Timer - Start BossMordrax_RT as a One-shot timer that will expire in BOSS_RT seconds
        Wait 30.00 seconds
        Unit - Remove BossMordrax from the game
